	<TextRow
		Label="msg_d23r0101_workman2c_02"
		Style="Large">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>きのうも　おんなじ……
あしたも　おんなじ……▼
へんかが　ないと　たいくつだよ
だから　しょうぶ　しても　いいよ▼</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-07-28T02:49:21" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-05-30T06:54:41" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>昨日も　おんなじ……
明日も　おんなじ……▼
変化が　ないと　退屈だよ
だから　勝負しても　いいよ▼</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-07-28T03:09:09" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-05-30T06:54:41" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<CommentCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Comment>♂
・workman_02表示後
・続けてトレーナー戦闘に</Comment>
			<CommentModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-05-30T06:51:04" />
		</CommentCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Character">
			<Text>WORKMAN2
鉱山作業員</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-05-30T06:43:06" />
		</AttributeCell>
		<ExtraCell
